OL,11,G1100 Traffic Cops
OL,12,     FOver 80,000 motorists lose their
OL,13,     Fdriving licence every year and
OL,14,     Fnearly ten percent of those are
OL,15,     Falready banned from driving. In
OL,16,     Fthis edition, cops clamp down on
